ree to test and explore the features provided by the SAP Forms service.For more information, see SAP Forms Service by Adobe (SAP Discovery Center).\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-01\nValid as Of: 2024-03-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3328 ---\nComponent: HTML5 Applications\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma\nTitle: Security Recommendations\nDescription: Security recommendations for the the application router have been published.   See SAP BTP Security Recommendations.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-07\nValid as Of: 2024-03-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3329 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: SAP BTP Operator becomes a default module\nDescription: SAP BTP Operator has been upgraded to a default Kyma module and is now automatically added to all new clusters. This enhancement ensures that Service Management is readily available. For more information, read the Kyma Modules document.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-07\nValid as Of: 2024-03-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3330 ---\nComponent: Object Store\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma\nTitle: Azure: A new approach for auto-expiration rules deletion\nDescription: A new approach to delete an auto-expiration rule has been introduced. Please refer Auto Expiration of Blobs and Blob Versions for more details.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-07\nValid as Of: 2024-03-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n\",216\n\n\nOutput:\n", "role": "user"}], "parameters": {"model": "unsloth/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct", "frequency_penalty": 0.0, "max_tokens": null, "n": 1, "presence_penalty": 0.0, "temperature": 0.0, "top_p": 1.0, "response_format": {"type": "json_object"}}}, "key": "cha